---
title: Payment gateway resilience (one pipeline per gateway)
---
flowchart LR
    gateway[HttpPaymentGateway]
    timeout[Timeout<br/>whole call]
    retry[Retry<br/>network errors, 408, 429, 5xx<br/>exponential back-off]
    breaker[Circuit breaker<br/>opens after N consecutive failures]
    provider(Payment provider)
    callbacks[OnRetry / OnOpened callbacks<br/>retry and circuit metrics + logs]

    gateway --> timeout --> retry --> breaker --> provider
    retry -.-> callbacks
    breaker -.-> callbacks

    provider -->|202| succeeded((Succeeded))
    provider -->|400| rejected((Rejected<br/>not retried → 402))
    provider -->|409| duplicate((Duplicate<br/>not retried → 409))
    breaker -->|open circuit, timeout<br/>or retries used up| providerError((ProviderError → 503<br/>client may retry<br/>with the same key))
